<title>SWEDEN: RALLYING-SWEDISH RALLY FINAL PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-SWEDISH RALLY FINAL PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>KARLSTAD, Sweden 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of  the Swedish rally which ended on Monday:</p>
<p> 1. Kenneth  Eriksson (Sweden) Subaru    3 hours 51 minutes and</p>
<p>49 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Carlos Sainz (Spain) Ford	     16 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Tommi Makinen (Finland) Mitsubishi  26 secs</p>
<p> 4. Colin McRae (Britain) Subaru	  31</p>
<p> 5. Tomas  Radstrom (Sweden) Toyota   2:58</p>
<p> 6. Armin Schwarz (Germany) Ford	3:56</p>
<p> 7. Mats Jansson (Sweden) Toyota	3:58</p>
<p> 8. Marcus Gronholm (Finland) Toyota  4:15</p>
<p> 9. Mats Jonsson (Sweden) Ford	  5:13</p>
<p> 10. Stig Blomqvist (Sweden) Ford     6:46</p>
<p>World championship standings (after two rounds)</p>
<p> 1. Sainz 12 points</p>
<p> 2 equal. Piero Liatti (Italy)</p>
<p> 2 equal. Eriksson  10</p>
<p> 4. Makinen	    8</p>
<p> 5. Schwarz	    4</p>
<p> 6. McRae		3</p>
</text>
